OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet, blustery but very mild
OL,6,Fstart with the rain turning heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes, with perhaps the odd rumble of
OL,8,Fthunder. Turning brighter but cooler
OL,9,Fthroughout the afternoon with some
OL,10,Fsunshine, and a few showers following.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA risk of some further
OL,13,Fshowers this evening and overnight,
OL,14,Fmainly towards Staffordshire and
OL,15,FDerbyshire. Turning cold under the
OL,16,Fclearer spells and brisk northwesterly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
