OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA breezy and cool feeling
OL,6,Fday with a mix of sunshine and
OL,7,Fshowers. The showers most frequent
OL,8,Facross the north, with the odd heavy
OL,9,Fand potentially thundery shower
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry and bright on Sunday with lighter
OL,14,Fwinds. Milder by Monday with rain and
OL,15,Fbrisk winds moving in from the west.
OL,16,FRain giving way to brighter skies on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
